        <mxCell id="caption" value="Fig. 1: TD-FALE-GAN architecture. The generator receives the low-light frame, a face-attention mask, and a brightness estimate. Training combines zero-reference losses, global and face-patch adversarial feedback, and detection guidance from a frozen YOLOv8 model. The dashed red arrow indicates the gradient path used to update the generator." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
